{
  "info": {
    "name": "Cento — AI Video Creation API",
    "_postman_id": "cento-ai-video-external-api-v1",
    "description": "External API for AI Video Generation.\n\nSend one request with plain text + settings → get back:\n1. `videoUrl` — hosted video file\n2. `ttsAudio` — base64 MP3 audio of the spoken prompt\n\n**Base URL variable:** Set `{{base_url}}` in your environment (e.g. `http://localhost:3000` for local testing).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Change this to your deployed domain (e.g. https://your-domain.com)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📁 External API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create AI Video (plain text → video + TTS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('success is true', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('videoUrl is present', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.videoUrl).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('ttsAudio is present (base64 string)', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.ttsAudio).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('enhancedPrompt is present', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.enhancedPrompt).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Auto-save videoUrl to environment for reuse",
                  "if (res.videoUrl) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('last_video_url', res.videoUrl);",
                  "    console.log('Video URL saved to environment variable: last_video_url');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "// Log enhanced prompt",
                  "if (res.enhancedPrompt) {",
                  "    console.log('Enhanced Prompt:', res.enhancedPrompt);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "// Log TTS audio length",
                  "if (res.ttsAudio) {",
                  "    console.log('TTS Audio base64 length:', res.ttsAudio.length, 'chars');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"a premium skincare serum product launch ad\",\n  \"userId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"duration\": 5\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/external/create-video",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "external", "create-video"]
            },
            "description": "**The main external endpoint.**\n\nProvide plain text + video settings. The server will automatically:\n1. Enhance your text into a cinematic prompt (GPT-4o-mini)\n2. Generate the video (fal.ai)\n3. Generate TTS audio of the prompt (OpenAI TTS)\n\n**Response contains:**\n- `videoUrl` — relative path to the video file (prefix with your domain)\n- `ttsAudio` — base64 MP3 string\n- `enhancedPrompt` — the AI-refined prompt used for generation\n\n⚠️ This request takes **1–3 minutes** — increase Postman timeout:\nSettings → General → Request timeout → set to `300000` (5 min)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "✅ Success Example",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"videoUrl\": \"/uploads/64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a/video/a1b2c3d4-ext-ai-generated.mp4\",\n  \"ttsAudio\": \"//uQxAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWGluZwAAAA8AAAACAAAB...(base64 mp3 string)...\",\n  \"enhancedPrompt\": \"A breathtaking slow dolly shot gliding through a neon-drenched futuristic megacity at midnight. Holographic billboards reflect off rain-slicked streets below as sleek autonomous vehicles streak through layered skyways above...\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"a premium skincare serum product launch ad\",\n  \"userId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"duration\": 5\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/external/create-video",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "external", "create-video"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "❌ Missing Required Field",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Field 'text' is required — provide your video description\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/external/create-video",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "external", "create-video"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📁 Internal APIs (Reference)",
      "description": "These are the underlying internal APIs. Third parties should use the External API above instead.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Enhance Prompt Only",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('success is true', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('refinedPrompt returned', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.refinedPrompt).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (res.refinedPrompt) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refined_prompt', res.refinedPrompt);",
                  "    console.log('Refined Prompt:', res.refinedPrompt);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roughPrompt\": \"a luxury perfume brand ad with elegant visuals\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ai-video/generate-prompt",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "ai-video", "generate-prompt"]
            },
            "description": "Enhances a rough text idea into a detailed cinematic video prompt.\n\nThe refined prompt is auto-saved to environment variable `refined_prompt` by the test script."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "✅ Success Example",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"refinedPrompt\": \"A breathtaking slow dolly shot gliding through a neon-drenched futuristic megacity at midnight...\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"roughPrompt\": \"a luxury perfume brand ad with elegant visuals\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ai-video/generate-prompt",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "ai-video", "generate-prompt"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Generate Video Only",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('success is true', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('videos array returned', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.videos).to.be.an('array').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (res.videos && res.videos[0]) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('last_video_url', res.videos[0].videoUrl);",
                  "    console.log('Video URL:', res.videos[0].videoUrl);",
                  "    console.log('Media ID:', res.videos[0].mediaId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"{{refined_prompt}}\",\n  \"userId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"duration\": 5,\n  \"numVideos\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ai-video/generate-video",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "ai-video", "generate-video"]
            },
            "description": "Generates video from an enhanced prompt.\n\nTip: Run 'Enhance Prompt Only' first — it saves `refined_prompt` to the environment which this request uses automatically via `{{refined_prompt}}`.\n\n⚠️ Takes 1–3 minutes. Set Postman timeout to 300000ms."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "✅ Success Example",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"videos\": [\n    {\n      \"videoUrl\": \"/uploads/64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a/video/a1b2c3d4-ai-generated.mp4\",\n      \"mediaId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890b\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"A breathtaking slow dolly shot...\",\n  \"userId\": \"64f3b2c1a4e2d1234567890a\",\n  \"model\": \"Wan 2.7\",\n  \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n  \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"duration\": 5,\n  \"numVideos\": 1\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ai-video/generate-video",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "ai-video", "generate-video"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
